body: "Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/908\\n\\nDeliver one source-resolution contract shared by the SDK and CLI. Results must identify requested input, selected source kind and package identity, expose ambiguity candidates and deterministic precedence, and provide exact disambiguation commands without guessing from a renamed extension directory."
